SO-101 robot model and mesh assets
==================================

Source: https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100
Original directory: Simulation/SO101
License: Apache License 2.0

The original so101_new_calib.xml and mesh files are preserved. LeRobot adds
pick_cube.xml and a Python action adapter. The adapter maps LeRobot's calibrated
joint convention (five values in degrees plus a 0-100 gripper value) to the
MuJoCo model's radians.
